{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>男團2PM官方YouTube頻道於本月6日公開了Nichkhun（尼坤）與成員Jun. K、祐榮重溫宿舍生活的最新影片。本應是溫馨的團聚，但網民的焦點卻全落在尼坤</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250628/1015668044032118784085693.jpeg/GdRzoLrLRPLJPTK0QvfhG_hray0pyJTmN2bjMzdm4zM\" alt=\"尼坤非常帥氣。（尼坤微博圖片）\"><figcaption>尼坤非常帥氣。（尼坤微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250812/1032039987165532160519806.jpeg/7fWSD2Si5mF6tvi2mxUyed4s-2HI9OfCRVwcf0VcHH8\" alt=\"尼坤五官非常精緻。（尼坤微博圖片）\"><figcaption>尼坤五官非常精緻。（尼坤微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131611534041288704103468.png/_a7EkVZmLvIe7DSW5kJiRo6XUN69GhFMVXzfwlV838I\" alt=\"尼坤發福樣引發網民熱議。（YouTube@2PM）\"><figcaption>尼坤發福樣引發網民熱議。（YouTube@2PM）</figcaption></figure><p>網民感嘆「泰國王子」樣貌崩壞</p><p>影片中他依然呈現「發福樣」，與昔日清秀的「泰國王子」形象大相逕庭，臉部輪廓顯得相當圓潤。尼坤近年的樣貌轉變多次成為焦點，甚至被指「發福嚴重成大叔」。不少網民感嘆歲月殘酷，直言「尼坤發福」後的樣貌令人震驚「男神點解變大叔」、「差啲認唔出係尼坤」。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131611531293888512629134.png/rQJvKPPwoc0zteehc1DGPUztRYuz5S4fAan8uQGp_Lk\" alt=\"變油膩。（YouTube@2PM）\"><figcaption>變油膩。（YouTube@2PM）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131611528638763008046237.png/MEmHHMhytBJADgmzgS3BUX_I6lS1GPeXmRbk-JkW5Pg\" alt=\"雙下巴。（YouTube@2PM）\"><figcaption>雙下巴。（YouTube@2PM）</figcaption></figure><p>日本開騷驚現激瘦回歸</p><p>正當外界以為尼坤會持續走樣，2PM近日在日本舉行《THE RETURN》演唱會，尼坤竟然奇蹟地「瘦返」！從後台合照及流出的影片可見，尼坤以極佳狀態現身舞台，不止五官變深邃，就連招牌的V面輪廓悉數回歸，視覺年齡瞬間回春。網民看到尼坤演唱會近照後紛紛留言：「明星果然係話瘦就瘦」、「重回顏值巔峰」。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131612647540920320915762.jpeg/9uc4or8p9nZRa8EpPiPvVWI8ucOkJ5b46P5OcOj-TnA\" alt=\"2PM近日在日本東京開騷。（ig@2pm_official_jp）\"><figcaption>2PM近日在日本東京開騷。（ig@2pm_official_jp）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131612645108092928912058.jpeg/jgXQXFG2j0K-cG908vIEJ_pYe0IwW928BvXUNAb11DQ\" alt=\"尼坤（左一）瘦身成功，狀態大勇。（ig@khunsta0624）\"><figcaption>尼坤（左一）瘦身成功，狀態大勇。（ig@khunsta0624）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260514/1131612642524270592682740.jpeg/DCKVY-yTxThmjQnW31y9__7ebjXWRJ3MnzLVBJ8y1QQ\" alt=\"顏值回歸。（ig@sumire808）\"><figcaption>顏值回歸。（ig@sumire808）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-16T04:10:55.831764+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":561,"images":8,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}